  "raw": {
    "https://www.suss.edu.sg/careers": {
      "title": "Careers @ SUSS",
      "description": "Careers @ SUSS | Job Opportunities at SUSS | SUSS  | SUSS This site uses cookies to offer you a better browsing experience. By continuing to navigate through this site or by clicking \"Close\", you are consenting to the use of cookies on your device as described in our privacy statement . Close Academics Programmes Undergraduate Graduate Programmes Law Programmes Explore Our Programmes Executive & Lifelong Learning Certificate Courses Continuing Education & Training (CET) Courses Workplace Safety and Health (WSH) Enhancement Courses Work-Study Post-Diploma (WSPostDip) Explore Our Courses SUSS Academy Schools & College S R Nathan School of Human Development School of Business School of Humanities and Behavioural Sciences School of Law School of Science and Technology School of Social Work and Social Development College of Interdisciplinary & Experiential Learning Faculty Listing Why SUSS SUSS Difference Student Employability SUSS Curriculum Multiple Pathways Student Testimonials Admissions Application Process Eligibility How to Apply International Students Indicative Grade Profile (IGP) After Application Pre-qualifications Adult Learners Scheme Financial Matters Tuition Fee & Subsidy Scholarships & Sponsorships Financial Aid Payment Modes Life at SUSS Onboarding Orientation Matriculation SUSS Student Card Student Insurance Campus Map and Facilities First Year Experience Health & Safety Accessible and Inclusive Learning Counselling & Life Coaching Student Wellness Student Safety Student Experiences Student Life Career Development Entrepreneurship Student Resources Student Success Centre Funding & Awards Learning Services Library Research News & Events SUSS News Campus Updates Media Releases Happenings Webinars & Events E-Open House Articles & Audio Blogs Partnerships About About SUSS Who We Are Our Milestones Leadership & Governance Annual Reports Media Centre SUSS New Campus Sustainability Campus Locations Engagement & Collaboration Centres Giving Procurement Join Us Careers Profile Student Student Portal Canvas CEX Portal Student Email Associate Faculty About Associate Faculty Learning & Development Engagement & Well-Being Associate Faculty Email Alumni Alumni Portal Alumni Email About SUSS Alumni OpenCerts Digital Certificates and Transcripts Search Search Home About Careers Join us to be impact-makers At SUSS, we aspire to be a powerhouse powerhouse of change, fueled by a deep sense of purpose. Embark on a transformative journey with us, and grow professionally, while enriching the lives of those around you. START YOUR SEARCH ‘Dream, Dare, Do’ with SUSS As Singapore's first institute for lifelong learning, we champion inclusivity to bring education to all and ensure that individuals are given equal opportunities to develop to their fullest potential and propel them to be impactful change-makers. We advocate the same for our people. We are committed to helping our employees dream big, dare greatly, and do what it takes to achieve transformational professional growth. Take the Leap As a purpose-drive organisation, we empower employees at different life stages to chase their dreams. We believe that learning is a lifelong endeavour that should be accessible to all.  We are committed to empowering you to reach your full potential through providing diverse and flexible learning opportunities, as well as job mobility. Additionally, to support both your personal and professional growth, we offer a holistic package that includes: Hybrid Work Arrangement (Subject to Job Role) Medical Benefits Flex Benefits Family Care Leave Volunteer Service Leave Wellness & Recreation Activities Lifelong Learning Opportunities Career Development Opportunities through Internal Job Postings and Transfers Unleashing Your Full Potential As our employee, you can look forward to reaching your full potential with thoughtfully curated initiatives, including mental and physical health activities, learning and development opportunities for all levels, and community involvement at our university. As an educational institution, learning and development is a way of life at SUSS! Learning is made accessible through bite-sized virtual learning, curated e-learning, and recognising informal learning. Our current and future leaders are also equipped with the necessary skill sets to thrive in our university’s transformational phase through our Leadership Coaching Programme . U Wellness , an integrated programme of activities, events, and initiatives aimed at providing a more holistic approach to work-life fit and building community connectedness, was launched in early 2023. This represents SUSS’ commitment and renewed emphasis on creating a human-centric work environment for our employees. Since our inception, SUSS has been a valued volunteer partner of AWWA and is recognised for our extraordinary contributions toward volunteerism. You can look forward to participating in any of our CSR initiatives or to supporting the voluntary welfare organisation of your choice with the Volunteer Service Leaves offered to all employees. Embark on a transformative journey with us, and grow professionally, while enriching the lives of those around you. Employee Testimonials Hear what our employees have to share about their experiences here at SUSS. Jave Tan, Deputy Head (Student Life) Work is never easy, but the camaraderie and motivation among teammates keep the hard times going. READ MORE Debra Bernadette L'Angellier, Senior Librarian Working at SUSS makes me feel like I am doing something good for society by helping people reach their potential no matter where they are in life. READ MORE Abdul Waheed, Senior Executive (School of Business) Working at SUSS has been fulfilling, with a culture that fosters collaboration and continuous learning. It's a joy to work with my colleagues... READ MORE Appointments and Vacancies Join us for a meaningful work experience in a collegial work environment and work alongside colleagues guided by our heart and values. A rewarding and challenging career awaits you here. YOUR IMPACT STARTS HERE Academic Appointments (Full-time) Lecturer, Senior Lecturer, Associate Professor etc LEARN MORE Academic Appointments (Part-time) Associates, Course Developer, Course Instructor etc LEARN MORE Professional Staff (Non-Academic) Administrative, HR, Finance, Communications, Educational Technology, Information Technology etc LEARN MORE Contract Appointments (1 Year Temp Assignment) Research Assistant, Project Executive, System Administrator etc LEARN MORE Temporary Appointments (Hourly Rated Temp) Exam Invigilator, Course Materials Co-ordinator/ Distributor, Ushers for event, Field Interviewers etc LEARN MORE About SUSS Who We Are Careers Contact Us Student Quicklinks Academics Admissions Life at SUSS Connect with SUSS SUSS Alumni Singapore University of Social Sciences Blk C@Clementi Campus 463 Clementi Road Singapore 599494 Privacy Statement Terms of Use Whistleblowing © 2026 Singapore University of Social Sciences. All rights reserved."
    },
