    "https://careers.suss.edu.sg/job/Lecturer-Senior-Lecturer-%28Social-Work%29/1247243466/": {
      "title": "Lecturer/ Senior Lecturer (Social Work)",
      "description": "Lecturer/ Senior Lecturer (Social Work) Job Details | Singapore University of Social Sciences Skip to main content SUSS Careers About SUSS Join Talent Community View All Jobs Find Us on LinkedIn Login/View Profile SUSS Careers About SUSS Join Talent Community View All Jobs Find Us on LinkedIn Login/View Profile SUSS Careers About SUSS Join Talent Community View All Jobs Find Us on Linkedin Login/View Profile Search by Keyword Show More Options Loading... Location All School/Department All Job Type All Select how often (in days) to receive an alert: Create Alert × Select how often (in days) to receive an alert: Apply now » Apply now Start apply with LinkedIn Apply Now Start Please wait... Lecturer/ Senior Lecturer (Social Work) Who We Are As Singapore's first institute for lifelong learning, the Singapore University of Social Sciences (SUSS) champions inclusivity to bring education to all and ensure that they are given equal opportunities to develop to their fullest potential in our diverse learning environment. We advocate for the same for our people. We believe everyone should have equal opportunities and develop to their fullest potential in their careers. Embark on an exciting lifelong journey with us in making a positive difference in your career and serving our society. For more information on Singapore University of Social Sciences, please visit www.suss.edu.sg What You Will Be Doing If you are passionate about communicating knowledge, and can demonstrate ability to work collaboratively and engage positively with colleagues and external stakeholders, we welcome you to join us! The successful applicant will jo in the Social Work discipline in the School of Social Work and Social Development (SWSD). T he responsibilities of full-time faculty members include teaching, managing and developing courses, conducting academic and/or applied research, and being involved in activities in the service of SUSS and also outside of SUSS that may include outreach to industry and also involvement in industry projects. Job Requirements Ph.D. degree holder in a relevant discipline. Applicant with teaching and/or working experience in the relevant areas will have an added advantage. What We Offer At SUSS, we advocate the Spirit of Learning and pride ourselves as lifelong learners. You will gain access to various learning platforms and plenty of development opportunities to support your growth in a meaningful career! Besides that, you will also get: Competitive Pay Package Hybrid Work Arrangement (Subject to Job Role) Medical Benefits Flex Benefits Family Care Leaves Volunteer Service Leaves Wellness & Recreation Activities Lifelong Learning Opportunities Career Development Opportunities through Internal Job Postings and Transfers Apply now » Apply now Start apply with LinkedIn Apply Now Start Please wait... Find similar jobs: View All Jobs, Academic Appointments Home SUSS Careers About SUSS Join Talent Community View All Jobs Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. © 2020 Singapore University of Social Sciences. All rights reserved."
